# .tagconn
Created by [tagconn](https://github.com/ilomon10/tagconn). No secrets or host-specific paths.
- `office.json`: this floor's saved office profile (layout, style, heroes). Safe to commit; tagconn offers to restore it on another machine.
- `work/`: the agents' working notes (backlog, plans, handoffs). Git-ignored.
To opt out in this repo, replace this folder with an empty file named `.tagconn` (tagconn then never writes here). To turn it off everywhere, reinstall with `--attribution no`.
